{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1934870/extras/9777660c6fab28be4121e14c09f7cef9.poster.avif?t=1765317868\" width=780 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1934870/extras/9777660c6fab28be4121e14c09f7cef9.webm?t=1765317868\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1934870/extras/9777660c6fab28be4121e14c09f7cef9.mp4?t=1765317868\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong><i>Wirm</i></strong> is a delightful physics climbing game about being a worm  on a tiny adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your soft squishy body to wiggle over obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monch your way through the dirt, and find hidden objects underground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring your friends and wiggle together in local multiplayer, or online through Steam's<i> Remote Play Together</i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0<span class=\"bb_strike\"> \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">hello there i am a <strong><i>wirm</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">come with me and watch me squirm</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">i would eat through dirt all day</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">climb rock, find shell, that's how we'll play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">b